            "id": 2021,
            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Leximi me fëmijën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2022-04-29T10:13:58+02:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EFri, 04/29/2022 - 10:13\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T04:20:43+02:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 04:20\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Ndërveproni me fëmijën tuaj. Flisni me fëmijën tuaj. Lexoni libra",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003ENdërveproni me fëmijën tuaj\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-1.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMbajeni fëmijën tuaj afër që ajo ta dëgjojë zërin tuaj dhe ta shohë fytyrën tuaj.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-2.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFlisni për atë që bëni ju dhe foshnja juaj.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-3.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKëndoni dhe ndihmoni fëmijën tuaj të kërcejë dhe të lëvizë në ritëm.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EFlisni me foshnjën tuaj\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-4.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPërsëritni tingujt që bën fëmija juaj.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-5.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EEmërtoni gjërat që fëmija juaj i shikon dhe bën me shenjë drejt tyre.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-6.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENdani me ta shumë tregime në cilëndo gjuhë\u003C/strong\u003E.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003ELexojuni libra\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-7.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EShikoni librat së bashku.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-8.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMbani librat në vende, ku fëmija juaj mund t'i arrijë ato.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-baby-from-birth-PIP-9.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELeximi me foshnjën tuaj që nga lindja: në fotografi © raisechildren.net\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ERegjistrohuni në bibliotekë - është falas.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
